  "description": "Generic OPC UA - OpenUSD connector tool. Connects to any server implementing the draft OPC UA - OpenUSD Bindings companion model, discovers Server/OpenUSD/Representations, subscribes to the bound Variables, optionally fetches the served USD asset closure (spec §5.15), and authors a live USD override layer (live.usda) plus an optional self-contained stage. Built on Opc.Ua.OpenUsd.Client.",
